<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange finished lower in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 51.18 to 6549.48.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 1.65 to 395.25.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.17.</p>
<p>Losers edged out winners 1272 to 1238.</p>
<p>Volume was 556,557,700 compared with 538,207,220 Tuesday.</p>
